<title>THAILAND: Thai money, stock markets closed on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Thai money, stock markets closed on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai financial markets will be closed on Tuesday for an annual holiday.</p>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Thailand closed down 0.90 points to end at 527.20 points on Monday.</p>
<p>The baht finished steady at 25.80/25.90 to the dollar late in the domestic market. Offshore the currency was traded at 24.80/25.10 late against 23.90/24.40 early.</p>
<p>The overnight interbank rate dropped to 13-15 percent late from 17-20 percent in the morning.</p>
<p>The markets will reopen on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
